## Rejection
<%
    role_title = role.get("title", role_id)
%>
Subject: Your Application – ${role_title}

Hi ${candidate_name},

Thank you for taking the time to apply for **${role_title}** and for your interest in joining us.

After careful consideration we have decided to move forward with other candidates at this time.

We genuinely appreciate your effort and encourage you to apply for future openings that match your profile.

Best regards,
${sender_name}
${org_name}
